If you do have a 2.88M floppy, yes you do have to use special media.  The
disks themselves are marked ED instead of HD next to the shutter.
It is also possible that your system is misreading the floppy drive type.
Typically 2.88M drives are marked 2.88M on the front or on the eject button.

